{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-27","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与比例与整数","englishTitle":"Similar solid numbers have to one another the ratio which a cube number has to a cube number.","book":8,"number":27,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.27","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.27/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":27,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","contentId":"euclid-8-27","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f38b3858e1719b51dae43ec893e2f44655cee7ee9488f8fc0987ec224a1a2ba","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-27.statement","euclid-8-27.construction.1","euclid-8-27.proof.1","euclid-8-27.construction.2","euclid-8-27.conclusion","euclid-8-27.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-27.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-27","revisionId":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67c15e4b5cec670c9bb97c65a3110cb6c16a6869e2ac243ed73cbbc78bf5459c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar solid numbers have to one another the ratio which a cube number has to a cube number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相似立体数比立方数比立方数比立方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-27.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-27","revisionId":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81ca2c7369f198d82f27ce3ab6aa97729ef6d106c2de2c4f7ba04542657e77fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be similar solid numbers; I say that A has to B the ratio which a cube number has to a cube number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是相似立体数;我说,A比B比立方数比立方数比立方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-27.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-27","revisionId":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9ce58472aafe138c9e511c41457070a7df300424dd415ee3be9e6945c07ed66","citations":["euclid-8-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B are similar solid numbers, therefore two mean proportional numbers fall between A, B. [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A以后,B是相似立体数,因此,有2 比例中项个数字在A和B之间下降。 [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-27.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-27","revisionId":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5eef0280e42d6cdee18901092d08a5f7e87ad28c9e90725d7e3fc1f02641e425","citations":["euclid-7-33","euclid-8-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let C, D so fall, and let E, F, G, H, the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with A, C, D, B, and equal with them in multitude, be taken; [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33) or [VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)] therefore the extremes of them E, H are cube. [[VIII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C,D,E,G,H, 与A,C,D,B的比例相同, 数量最少的, 数量也最多, [ [VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33) [VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2) [[VIII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-27.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-27","revisionId":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e001ce785ed99f2c10decf3e8747956e37808a3b7d2a0949cdc8f1b45bed335","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as E is to H, so is A to B; therefore A also has to B the ratio which a cube number has to a cube number. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E比H等于A比B,因此A比B,立方数比立方数比立方数。 Q比E；E 与 H 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-27.source","contentId":"euclid-8-27","revisionId":"euclid-8-27@raw-9f38b3858e1719b5","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb5f971b885a2d1ed0952e3b6808d7edd3313e08a737fbe10feba53e94051669","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.27/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.27\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-27:euclid-8-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-27.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.27","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.27/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 19"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-27:euclid-7-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-27","source